{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"ZFC"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"ZFC"},2],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"数学基础","text":null}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"逻辑","text":null}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>ZFC 是一个关于"},{"Local":{"url":"质料集合论","text":"质料集合论"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"一阶语言","text":"一阶理论"}},{"Plain":", 只有一个类型 $V$, “所有东西都是集合”, 集合的元素是集合. (也有一些 ZFC 的变体允许集合的元素是其它类型的对象.)</p>\n"}]}}